      "content": "It's unsettling and worrisome to experience such a drastic change in your life, especially after 12 years of dedicated service. While a single company may not have an all-encompassing reach, it's not impossible that they have a significant influence on your past. Companies like pharmaceutical giants often have extensive records and networks, but it's unlikely that a single person would be able to erase someone's entire identity overnight. You may want to consider seeking help from a local authorities or a lawyer to help you understand what's happening and protect your rights.",
