      "role": "user",
      "content": "i thought about a lawyer but everything feels rigged. like, if i go to the police, how do i explain that my bank froze my account the same week my passport \"disappeared\" from the federal database? it's not just \"influence,\" it's like they're trying to make me non-existent. i saw the same black SUV idling near my house three nights in a row. it's not just a coincidence, right? it feels too calculated to be random.",
